(facts it saw, not a verdict)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"1fb1c24011ee49acc92c5d4dd4b06736","originalFileName":"5d1534b5-2aad-4484-b8cf-2b696eb047e4-attachment.json","ext":".json","name":"oracle verdict","contentType":"application/json","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":4486},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #23): Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1) — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass"},"testCase":{"id":"bf9b96d6c728ba9262d13167d7beef53","externalId":"7978570b6ab9fb317fc89035dbc7f756","name":"[dev] S17 Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN","fullName":"TC-03 Search & Sort › TC-03/S17"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>S17</b> 「搜索进行中切换模式：每个列表都拒绝另一个模式的名字和 MRN」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Hospital: search by name, by room, by MRN and by diagnosis each returns the correct matching patients, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 2；TFA-92581 AC 5）</li><li><b>U4</b> Nursing Home: search by name, by unit/room, by MRN and by facility each returns the correct matching residents, each field on its own.（UAT TC-03；TFA-92581 AC 3；TFA-92581 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>状态迁移（state-transition） — 按先后顺序走（加 → 改 → 删、第 1 天 → 第 2 天、离线 → 在线），每一步之后看状态对不对。</p><p><b>Given </b>Standard fixture</p><p><b>When </b>Hospital: search 'QA Hosp', then 'QA Resident'. Switch to Nursing Home and note the resident's MRN from the card. Search 'QA Hosp' there. Switch back to Hospital. Search 'QA Resident', then the resident's MRN</p><p><b>Then </b>Hospital never lists the resident, even when searched by the resident's name or MRN, before or after a switch. Nursing Home never lists the Hospital patient, even when searched by its name. Each such search says nothing matches</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>oracle.mjs: cp1 mustContain {hospitalPatient}, mustNotContain {snfResident}. cp2, cp6 and cp7 mustContain 'No patients match', mustNotContain {snfResident}. cp3 mustContain 'heading &quot;Nursing Home&quot;' and {snfResident}, mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}. cp4 mustContain 'No residents match', mustNotContain {hospitalPatient}. …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U23；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S17 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-03.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-03 Search &amp; Sort · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-03/S17</p><p><b>Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92581 Search &amp; Sort (ready for qa)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U23.verdict.json</code>), unit U23 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 263 s, $0.60.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U23 (#23, ready-for-qa, ui-only) — Search box, both contexts. Same legacy seed, same search box, read-only typing (diagnosis words, names / MRN across contexts, fast re-type and whitespace). No part opens a chart or changes a row. Runs together with TC-03/S07, TC-03/S20.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #23, U23; checked: yes): <b>Fail (S07 only, product — cluster C1)</b> — S07: NH search for 'hip fracture' matches the resident by diagnosis (should say No residents match); search hint offers 'diagnosis'. S17 (search across mode switches), S20 (retype/clear/spaces) pass</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-03 Search & Sort","S17 Switch context with a search in progress: each list refuses the other context's names and MRN"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"dfeaba393340637085f869061bccb719","originalFileName":"0c9185a8-9b97-454f-9ed8-6a1c6ca51cda-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2610,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"5b103bc2193f82c5c7ed3e63eab61742","originalFileName":"5050fca7-5768-484d-a0ef-70b7652b7734-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":75600},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"d38680a4978e855b7c5b913924b79c4a","originalFileName":"04b0b921-7c2d-4739-9493-0b2cb5e7bf21-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1976,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"4ba7f3f9a8eec4047164ea5c1966681d","originalFileName":"e3181295-2c59-4d75-ba71-ac30310765fc-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":66830},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"34b052fc6c8da6029ab34a2752563d2e","originalFileName":"44f89dc4-d47e-40cc-aadf-e49c31786c89-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)","contentType":"text/plain","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":2134},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"b28239a5ffdc15e646e1589d5580f34b","originalFileName":"9838c1f2-bda3-491e-abbf-84c9e4191929-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":70298},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used